1
00:00:02,450 --> 00:00:08,030
Wake up early in the morning, trying to figure out how to get my point across the many rivers of doubt.

2
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:11,010
Cause it's got us in a chokehold, a conundrum if you will.

3
00:00:11,110 --> 00:00:15,510
I feel like I was called back to music because music is the most potent way to connect to folks.

4
00:00:15,890 --> 00:00:17,730
For the people, we ain't going nowhere.

5
00:00:17,730 --> 00:00:21,110
Our bodies make music, nature makes music.

6
00:00:21,510 --> 00:00:24,950
Thus we're on a frequency that connects directly to music.

7
00:00:26,210 --> 00:00:28,730
I also got tired of just talking like everybody else.

8
00:00:28,730 --> 00:00:33,070
We know the way is to preserve the knowledge, the names, the words.

9
00:00:33,310 --> 00:00:37,590
Almost bust my ass.

10
00:00:37,850 --> 00:00:45,270
Ancestral transmissions, 4K visions of the end of empire when we vibrate higher, higher, higher, higher.

